      {
        "parameters": {
          "promptType": "define",
          "text": "={{ $json.body.text }}",
          "hasOutputParser": true,
          "options": {
            "systemMessage": "=You are an intelligent AI assistant whose job is to analyze a user's healthcare-related question and determine the most appropriate expert AI to respond.\n\nYour task is:\n1. Do NOT alter, translate, or reword the user’s original question in any way. Keep it exactly as it is.\n2. Analyze the user's question or request.\n3. Classify it into one of the following expert AI roles and choose the corresponding number:\n   - \"General Practitioner AI\" — for common symptoms and general health advice (Choose 1)\n   - \"Pharmacist AI\" — for medication-related questions (Choose 2)\n   - \"Medical Analyst AI\" — for interpreting lab results, vital signs, or medical data (Choose 3)\n   - \"Medical Specialist AI\" — for deep clinical or complex medical inquiries (Choose 4)\n   - \"Health Coach AI\" — for wellness, nutrition, exercise, or preventive lifestyle advice (Choose 5)\n\n4. If the question is unrelated to medicine or health, randomly choose a number from 1 to 5.\n\n5. Return your output **only** in the following JSON format:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"userQuery\": \"user question here\",\n  \"choose\": \"selected number here\"\n}\n"
          }
        },
        "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
        "typeVersion": 2.1,
        "position": [
          208,
